    "description":  "\u003ch1\u003eFeatures\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eColored background for keys and keycards according to which map they belongs to.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMaps, Extracts, Quests and Loot information in the item descriptions.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePossibility to rename all keys to add a custom prefix based on the map they “belong to”.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsers can copy the config.jsonc file to a file named configuser.jsonc which will be read in priority if present. This allows to keep your config while updating (You will need to copy/paste any new entry if/when they appear in the config.jsonc though)\u003c/p\u003e\n",
